      "content": "I'll read both the original test and the CUT source to understand what needs to be improved.Now I have a clear picture of what the test does. I'll write an improved version with:\n- Descriptive variable names and constants to clarify the cryptic EvoSuite string\n- `assertNotNull` moved before dependent assertions\n- Comments explaining the two logical steps\n- A meaningful test method nameNow let me compile-check it.The improved test compiled successfully. The refactored test extracts the cryptic EvoSuite string into named constants (`MIXED_CASE_TAG` / `NORMALIZED_TAG`), moves `assertNotNull` before the dependent assertions, adds a descriptive method name, and uses comments to separate the two logical parts (case-preservation behavior and copy-equality)."
